  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Revolve Spin 17 is a pentagonal co-polyester featuring UHMW low-friction technology and Crosslink Ester Polymer construction. Compared with the 16 gauge version, the thinner 17 gauge offers enhanced feel, greater ball pocketing and slightly easier access to spin while maintaining the signature Revolve Spin bite and tension stability.",

    "zh": "Wilson Revolve Spin 17 是一款五角形聚酯球线，采用 UHMW 低摩擦材料和 Crosslink Ester Polymer 配方。相比 16 号径，17（1.25mm）拥有更好的手感、更明显的 Ball Pocketing、更容易产生旋转，同时保持 Revolve Spin 系列标志性的 Ball Bite、Spin 与优秀的保磅表现。"
  },

